<title>POLAND: Poland offers to sell PLN 200 mln 1-yr bond Jan 28.</title>
<headline>Poland offers to sell PLN 200 mln 1-yr bond Jan 28.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish treasury offered to sell 200 million zlotys of its one-year floating bonds at the primary tender on January 28, 1997, the central bank said.</p>
<p>It said the value date for the auction of the bonds, maturing on March 4, 1998, will be on February 3, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
